@edison1105 I was wrong and my problem is not relative to this issue.

https://sfc.vuejs.org/#

For some reason `scrollIntoView()` triggers transition. Could it somehow be related to vue? Seems that this is browser behavior but I'm not sure

@edikdeisling 
this is because `scrollIntoView()` triggers [forces layout/reflow](https://gist.github.com/paulirish/5d52fb081b3570c81e3a) and `layout/reflow` will restart a CSS animation.
see https://www.harrytheo.com/blog/2021/02/restart-a-css-animation-with-javascript/
